\f0\fs24 \cf2 Project 1: Building an AI Agent for Dimension Reduction and Exploratory Data Analysis\
In this project, you will build an AI agent that automatically performs exploratory data analysis\
through dimension reduction. Unlike a traditional benchmarking study, your goal is to develop an\
automated analysis system that can analyze previously unseen datasets with minimal human\
intervention.\
Given a new dataset, your agent should automatically determine an appropriate analysis\
workflow, execute the selected methods, evaluate the results, and generate a summary of its\
findings.\
Requirements\
Task\
Your agent should automatically perform the following steps:\
Inspect the dataset (e.g., number of samples, number of features, missing values, sparsity,\
feature types, etc.).\
Recommend and perform appropriate preprocessing when necessary.\
Select one or more suitable dimension reduction methods.\
Select appropriate hyperparameters.\
Generate low-dimensional representations and visualizations.\
Evaluate the resulting embeddings using appropriate quantitative or qualitative criteria.\
Produce a final analysis report summarizing the decisions and findings.\
The objective is to build a system that can analyze new datasets automatically rather than\
manually applying every available algorithm.\
